  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Assist&#xea;ncia Alimentar Emergencial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Food Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">O objectivo &#xe9; fornecer apoio vital e melhorar as condi&#xe7;&#xf5;es de vida das pessoas afectadas por conflitos em Cabo Delgado atrav&#xe9;s de uma resposta integrada que visa garantir o acesso atempado e sustent&#xe1;vel &#xe0;s necessidades b&#xe1;sicas em WASH, abrigo/NFI e seguran&#xe7;a alimentar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to provide life-saving support and improve living conditions for conflict affected people in cabo delgado through an integrated response aimed to ensure timely and sustainable access to basic needs in WASH, shelter/NFI, and food security.</narrative>
  </description>
